(7353225, 1150597, 123833, '<td valign="top">Ah, long exposure in Venice</td>', 'Ah, long exposure in Venice', '2015-05-25 17:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353226, 1150607, 123833, '<td valign="top">Nice PP</td>', 'Nice PP', '2015-05-25 17:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353230, 1150375, 177322, '<td valign="top">The almost even distribution of the three elements - air, water, earth - is attractive. The brooding sky adds nice tension to the remarkable calm sea and soft sand.  And, a nice straight horizon zaps my technical side with a little jolt of elation!  Lovely image.  Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'The almost even distribution of the three elements - air, water, earth - is attractive. The brooding sky adds nice tension to the remarkable calm sea and soft sand.  And, a nice straight horizon zaps my technical side with a little jolt of elation!  Lovely image.  Hope it does well for you.', '2015-05-25 17:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353232, 1150593, 177322, '<td valign="top">The iridescence-like color in the water is quite striking and nicely contrasted by the rich red of the earth at the fence line to the left and splash on the right tree. Enchanting play of light.  Nicely framed composition with sharp detail.  Beautiful.  Good luck.</td>', 'The iridescence-like color in the water is quite striking and nicely contrasted by the rich red of the earth at the fence line to the left and splash on the right tree. Enchanting play of light.  Nicely framed composition with sharp detail.  Beautiful.  Good luck.', '2015-05-25 18:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353233, 1150598, 114225, '<td valign="top">I love this type of shot. Ominous sky with smooth-ish water.</td>', 'I love this type of shot. Ominous sky with smooth-ish water.', '2015-05-25 18:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353234, 1150639, 114225, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lot of the landscapes around here.</td>', 'Looks like a lot of the landscapes around here.', '2015-05-25 18:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353236, 1150593, 114225, '<td valign="top">So serene.</td>', 'So serene.', '2015-05-25 18:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353238, 1150637, 114225, '<td valign="top">Perfect light for this.<br/>My gripe is that the chromatic aberration is out of control.</td>', 'Perfect light for this.My gripe is that the chromatic aberration is out of control.', '2015-05-25 18:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353239, 1150554, 114225, '<td valign="top">The clouds look really strange.</td>', 'The clouds look really strange.', '2015-05-25 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353240, 1150509, 114225, '<td valign="top">My favorite type of morning.</td>', 'My favorite type of morning.', '2015-05-25 18:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353241, 1150609, 114225, '<td valign="top">This feels like it could use some sharpening.</td>', 'This feels like it could use some sharpening.', '2015-05-25 18:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353242, 1150574, 114225, '<td valign="top">Why is the sky that color? Seems weird.</td>', 'Why is the sky that color? Seems weird.', '2015-05-25 18:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353243, 1150675, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like a scene from a movie.</td>', 'Wow, looks like a scene from a movie.', '2015-05-25 18:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353244, 1150478, 50864, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this. Favorite in the challenge. 10</td>', 'I like everything about this. Favorite in the challenge. 10', '2015-05-25 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353245, 1150657, 50864, '<td valign="top">Lovely, dainty.</td>', 'Lovely, dainty.', '2015-05-25 18:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353246, 1150642, 50864, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Nice processing. Top pick.</td>', 'Very pretty. Nice processing. Top pick.', '2015-05-25 18:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353248, 1150658, 50864, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of the boys head and the one bird. Very nice..</td>', 'Love the angle of the boys head and the one bird. Very nice..', '2015-05-25 18:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353249, 1150630, 177322, '<td valign="top">Initial Reaction:  Wow! Powerful sky.  Heartily applaud the far bank and trees angling towards an off-image vanishing point created by the benches and posts. Some folks might protest the subtle frame: I like it.  Maybe I, personally, would have cloned out that teensy white box on the water between the 2nd &amp; 3rd posts, but certainly it is nothing that detracts from the overall impressive impact of this well crafted B&amp;W.  Good luck!</td>', 'Initial Reaction:  Wow! Powerful sky.  Heartily applaud the far bank and trees angling towards an off-image vanishing point created by the benches and posts. Some folks might protest the subtle frame: I like it.  Maybe I, personally, would have cloned out that teensy white box on the water between the 2nd & 3rd posts, but certainly it is nothing that detracts from the overall impressive impact of this well crafted B&W.  Good luck!', '2015-05-25 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353250, 1150288, 177322, '<td valign="top">Unique interpretation for this challenge.  Plenty of interesting shapes and splashes of color on the distant bank.  Good exposure.  Nicely framed.  Just wish the subject of the title, the gulls, could have been in focus.</td>', 'Unique interpretation for this challenge.  Plenty of interesting shapes and splashes of color on the distant bank.  Good exposure.  Nicely framed.  Just wish the subject of the title, the gulls, could have been in focus.', '2015-05-25 18:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353252, 1150511, 177322, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t have somehow worked this into the concurrent ''Abstract in Green'' challenge because it features an admirable abstract quality softened by that almost invisible oasis. Talented framing effectively draws the eye down to the point of interest and defies the Rule of Thirds. I think you may have been able to crop out the top sky with no harm done to the vision of this image. This is a compelling photo for this challenge accurately defined by the title.  Nice work.  Good luck.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t have somehow worked this into the concurrent ''Abstract in Green'' challenge because it features an admirable abstract quality softened by that almost invisible oasis. Talented framing effectively draws the eye down to the point of interest and defies the Rule of Thirds. I think you may have been able to crop out the top sky with no harm done to the vision of this image. This is a compelling photo for this challenge accurately defined by the title.  Nice work.  Good luck.', '2015-05-25 18:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353254, 1150652, 177322, '<td valign="top">Joy, indeed.  This is a delight!</td>', 'Joy, indeed.  This is a delight!', '2015-05-25 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353256, 1150222, 177322, '<td valign="top">How poignant!</td>', 'How poignant!', '2015-05-25 18:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353261, 1150477, 177322, '<td valign="top">Applaudably bold take on this challenge.  This sky is an odd color and mixes curiously with the sea, but I like this.  The diagonal created by those black rocks slashing across the image makes a strong statement. Wishing you good fortune with this ''out-of-the-box'' interpretation.</td>', 'Applaudably bold take on this challenge.  This sky is an odd color and mixes curiously with the sea, but I like this.  The diagonal created by those black rocks slashing across the image makes a strong statement. Wishing you good fortune with this ''out-of-the-box'' interpretation.', '2015-05-25 18:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353265, 1150532, 177322, '<td valign="top">For me, the xanthous hue is almost overbearing. There appears to be some sort of unfortunately smudge at the top of the mountain on the left.  Yet, the composition and framing are quite good.  This may have been prettier with different lighting conditions, but time may not have been your friend for that kind of capture.</td>', 'For me, the xanthous hue is almost overbearing. There appears to be some sort of unfortunately smudge at the top of the mountain on the left.  Yet, the composition and framing are quite good.  This may have been prettier with different lighting conditions, but time may not have been your friend for that kind of capture.', '2015-05-25 18:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353282, 1150658, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful effect of the birds and the boy flying/running in opposite directions. <br/>bump</td>', 'Wonderful effect of the birds and the boy flying/running in opposite directions. bump', '2015-05-25 20:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353283, 1150657, 124815, '<td valign="top">Like a music score. Beautiful and bump</td>', 'Like a music score. Beautiful and bump', '2015-05-25 20:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
