(7353285, 1150567, 124815, '<td valign="top">The sprinkle of people makes this is lovely shot<br/>bump</td>', 'The sprinkle of people makes this is lovely shotbump', '2015-05-25 20:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353286, 1150351, 124815, '<td valign="top">Definitely a feel good image<br/>bump</td>', 'Definitely a feel good imagebump', '2015-05-25 20:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353287, 1150607, 124815, '<td valign="top">A palpable silence pervades. Beautiful and restrait<br/>bump</td>', 'A palpable silence pervades. Beautiful and restraitbump', '2015-05-25 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353288, 1150511, 124815, '<td valign="top">The attraction of parallels and perpendiculars - I might like it more without any sky at the top.<br/>bump</td>', 'The attraction of parallels and perpendiculars - I might like it more without any sky at the top.bump', '2015-05-25 20:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353289, 1150675, 124815, '<td valign="top">Fairy land<br/>bump</td>', 'Fairy landbump', '2015-05-25 20:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353290, 1150559, 124815, '<td valign="top">A sturdy and attractive picture<br/>bump</td>', 'A sturdy and attractive picturebump', '2015-05-25 20:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353292, 1150440, 61012, '<td valign="top">Great light</td>', 'Great light', '2015-05-25 20:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353310, 1150626, 114285, '<td valign="top">Bleak, and a real sense of loneliness, I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Bleak, and a real sense of loneliness, I gave you a 7.', '2015-05-25 21:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353328, 1150478, 124815, '<td valign="top">Am totally in love with this image. The poise in spite of all calamities, the waiting game - all is just wonderful,<br/>bump of course</td>', 'Am totally in love with this image. The poise in spite of all calamities, the waiting game - all is just wonderful,bump of course', '2015-05-25 22:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353370, 1150663, 177322, '<td valign="top">Nice ipresentation of this natural wonder.  What a perilous position that boat seems to be in - perfect for scale.</td>', 'Nice ipresentation of this natural wonder.  What a perilous position that boat seems to be in - perfect for scale.', '2015-05-26 00:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353372, 1150636, 177322, '<td valign="top">I want to eat breakfast - leisurely, over a couple hours - here, basking in this serene mood, watching the birds and the clouds, sipping coffee, murmuring to my companion.  Looks like I might need to don my Wellies, though!<br/> <br/>Beautifully framed by the fence.  I''m not a fan of the processing - there are some screaming greens in the distant trees, but I don''t care.  This is lovely.</td>', 'I want to eat breakfast - leisurely, over a couple hours - here, basking in this serene mood, watching the birds and the clouds, sipping coffee, murmuring to my companion.  Looks like I might need to don my Wellies, though! Beautifully framed by the fence.  I''m not a fan of the processing - there are some screaming greens in the distant trees, but I don''t care.  This is lovely.', '2015-05-26 00:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353376, 1150574, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a peaceful scene.  The color seems a bit odd; the cows in the foreground appear a tad flattened.  I like that, in the framing, the tree perfectly anchors the right side.</td>', 'What a peaceful scene.  The color seems a bit odd; the cows in the foreground appear a tad flattened.  I like that, in the framing, the tree perfectly anchors the right side.', '2015-05-26 00:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353379, 1150580, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a nice pastoral scene contrasted with that tumultuous sky!  Personally, I wonder how this might be if more of the grass had been cropped putting more of an emphasis on the sky to match the title?  Just a thought.</td>', 'What a nice pastoral scene contrasted with that tumultuous sky!  Personally, I wonder how this might be if more of the grass had been cropped putting more of an emphasis on the sky to match the title?  Just a thought.', '2015-05-26 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353380, 1150675, 177322, '<td valign="top">Magical! The strong foreground falls seductively back to the red splashes of blooms which, in turn, yield to that equally strong background. The prowess of your processing is magnificent. This deserves to ribbon.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Magical! The strong foreground falls seductively back to the red splashes of blooms which, in turn, yield to that equally strong background. The prowess of your processing is magnificent. This deserves to ribbon.  Best of luck.', '2015-05-26 00:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353390, 1150675, 52713, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge. Beautiful tones.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge. Beautiful tones.', '2015-05-26 01:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353392, 1150674, 52713, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range. I little heavy in the shadows. Black point too high, maybe? Still a 7 from me.</td>', 'Great tonal range. I little heavy in the shadows. Black point too high, maybe? Still a 7 from me.', '2015-05-26 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353393, 1150375, 52713, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of movement.</td>', 'Nice sense of movement.', '2015-05-26 01:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353395, 1150652, 52713, '<td valign="top">I like the pastel colors,in this one.</td>', 'I like the pastel colors,in this one.', '2015-05-26 01:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353396, 1150564, 52713, '<td valign="top">Nice golden hour light on the buildings. Well captured.</td>', 'Nice golden hour light on the buildings. Well captured.', '2015-05-26 01:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353398, 1150439, 52713, '<td valign="top">Nice kicks! The shoes are a clever element.</td>', 'Nice kicks! The shoes are a clever element.', '2015-05-26 01:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353427, 1150563, 135744, '<td valign="top">You are very lucky to have a backyard like that. Wonderfully captured too.</td>', 'You are very lucky to have a backyard like that. Wonderfully captured too.', '2015-05-26 04:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353428, 1150375, 135744, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. Very nice!</td>', 'One of my top picks. Very nice!', '2015-05-26 04:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353429, 1150675, 135744, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene and wonderfully captured.</td>', 'Beautiful scene and wonderfully captured.', '2015-05-26 04:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353442, 1150591, 124815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful<br/>The title is misleading but I don''t mind<br/>bump</td>', 'BeautifulThe title is misleading but I don''t mindbump', '2015-05-26 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353531, 1150582, 30364, '<td valign="top">A competently executed picture with a beautiful sense of depth reaching out into the scene (looks like a Frederick McCubbin painting).  But it''s a bit boring and passÃ©.  Why not try an original take on an Australian landscape?  I can''t get too excited about something I''ve seen a thousand times before, no matter how well crafted it is. 5.</td>', 'A competently executed picture with a beautiful sense of depth reaching out into the scene (looks like a Frederick McCubbin painting).  But it''s a bit boring and passÃ©.  Why not try an original take on an Australian landscape?  I can''t get too excited about something I''ve seen a thousand times before, no matter how well crafted it is. 5.', '2015-05-26 09:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353539, 1150519, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, though too strident in the savagely saturated colours.  And it''s just not very interesting; certainly you have held Sanders'' attention, but he has no choice.  Given the choice I reckon he''d rather be elsewhere.  Me too, I''m afraid, because there''s nothing there I want to linger over. 5.</td>', 'Nicely composed, though too strident in the savagely saturated colours.  And it''s just not very interesting; certainly you have held Sanders'' attention, but he has no choice.  Given the choice I reckon he''d rather be elsewhere.  Me too, I''m afraid, because there''s nothing there I want to linger over. 5.', '2015-05-26 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353560, 1150563, 30364, '<td valign="top">A well composed landscape but with nothing much else to recommend it.  A harsh judgement I know, but even allowing for the fact that most landscapes are boring and passive, this one is still resolutely limp and lacking in any hint of originality.  Can you really be satisfied to do nothing more than what so many have, alas, done before?  It''s a safe landscape, ticks most of the landscape boxes, but they''re all empty.  5.</td>', 'A well composed landscape but with nothing much else to recommend it.  A harsh judgement I know, but even allowing for the fact that most landscapes are boring and passive, this one is still resolutely limp and lacking in any hint of originality.  Can you really be satisfied to do nothing more than what so many have, alas, done before?  It''s a safe landscape, ticks most of the landscape boxes, but they''re all empty.  5.', '2015-05-26 09:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353561, 1150631, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting and dynamic.  The verticals all work very nicely and the rocket is positioned plumb in Position A (excellent timing by you).   All in all a splendid orchestration of static versus action, and thus way more interesting than the average ''launch'' shot.  7.</td>', 'It''s interesting and dynamic.  The verticals all work very nicely and the rocket is positioned plumb in Position A (excellent timing by you).   All in all a splendid orchestration of static versus action, and thus way more interesting than the average ''launch'' shot.  7.', '2015-05-26 09:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353562, 1150654, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice light but not much of interest beyond that.  It feels a bit two-dimensional and short on ambition as far as point-of-view goes.  Safe enough as a landscape photograph, but safe only reaches as far as middle of the pack.  Safe just can''t get you any further than that.  5.</td>', 'Nice light but not much of interest beyond that.  It feels a bit two-dimensional and short on ambition as far as point-of-view goes.  Safe enough as a landscape photograph, but safe only reaches as far as middle of the pack.  Safe just can''t get you any further than that.  5.', '2015-05-26 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353566, 1150611, 30364, '<td valign="top">Most landscapes are boring, and this one has nothing much to suggest otherwise.  It''s a competent enough photograph, but of nothing of interest.  Light tower, ferry and distant skyline; it really doesn''t do justice to this wonderfully exotic, vibrant location.  But for a few visually insignificant minarets and domes, it could be Blackpool or somewhere equally drab and dull.  There must be a more ambitious and original point of view than this.  5.</td>', 'Most landscapes are boring, and this one has nothing much to suggest otherwise.  It''s a competent enough photograph, but of nothing of interest.  Light tower, ferry and distant skyline; it really doesn''t do justice to this wonderfully exotic, vibrant location.  But for a few visually insignificant minarets and domes, it could be Blackpool or somewhere equally drab and dull.  There must be a more ambitious and original point of view than this.  5.', '2015-05-26 10:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353567, 1150477, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Fills the senses; all of them, by suggestion, not just the visual.  Smells, sounds, all that.  Well done you.  7.</td>', 'This is very nice.  Fills the senses; all of them, by suggestion, not just the visual.  Smells, sounds, all that.  Well done you.  7.', '2015-05-26 10:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353568, 1150607, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice if fairly standard composition.  Unusual tones, but that''s a good thing given the otherwise uninspired point-of-view.  6.</td>', 'Nice if fairly standard composition.  Unusual tones, but that''s a good thing given the otherwise uninspired point-of-view.  6.', '2015-05-26 10:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353569, 1150280, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s a photograph doing all it can to be not very interesting.  The foreground detracts from the background and the background detracts from the foreground.  I can''t find anything to admire in this one, I''m afraid.  Sorry.  3.</td>', 'Well, that''s a photograph doing all it can to be not very interesting.  The foreground detracts from the background and the background detracts from the foreground.  I can''t find anything to admire in this one, I''m afraid.  Sorry.  3.', '2015-05-26 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353570, 1150645, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the picture because its vibrant and interesting, and offers an unfamiliar point of view.  Some might argue it''s not a landscape, but I''ve seen their landscapes and you''d do well to ignore them, just as you have.  Lovely tones too, but the best thing is it''s something original and thoughtful.  Good for you. 8.</td>', 'Love the picture because its vibrant and interesting, and offers an unfamiliar point of view.  Some might argue it''s not a landscape, but I''ve seen their landscapes and you''d do well to ignore them, just as you have.  Lovely tones too, but the best thing is it''s something original and thoughtful.  Good for you. 8.', '2015-05-26 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353579, 1150663, 138630, '<td valign="top">A grand scene.  I think the boat contributes nicely, but I find the con trails distracting.  <br/>Commenting only at this point - accepting <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #7 in my random display order.</td>', 'A grand scene.  I think the boat contributes nicely, but I find the con trails distracting.  Commenting only at this point - accepting  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #7 in my random display order.', '2015-05-26 10:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353580, 1150477, 138630, '<td valign="top">Love the colors - the peach and pale aqua are lovely together.  I also like the three part composition - square of pink and triangles of green and shore.  However, the scene is not that interesting to me.<br/>Commenting only at this point - accepting <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #8 in my random display order.</td>', 'Love the colors - the peach and pale aqua are lovely together.  I also like the three part composition - square of pink and triangles of green and shore.  However, the scene is not that interesting to me.Commenting only at this point - accepting  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #8 in my random display order.', '2015-05-26 10:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353581, 1150564, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice time of day for a shot and the scope of this cityscape is impressive.  Lower half of the sky is pretty but the sky is unremarkable otherwise, the dark foliage and building don''t do much for me either.  I actually expect more nature and less man-made in a landscape.  <br/>Commenting only at this point - accepting <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #9 in my random display order.</td>', 'Nice time of day for a shot and the scope of this cityscape is impressive.  Lower half of the sky is pretty but the sky is unremarkable otherwise, the dark foliage and building don''t do much for me either.  I actually expect more nature and less man-made in a landscape.  Commenting only at this point - accepting  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #9 in my random display order.', '2015-05-26 10:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353582, 1150528, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice frame and I like the focus and textures on it.  The scene beyond is a bit soft and lacks impact for me. <br/>Commenting only at this point - accepting <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #10 in my random display order.</td>', 'Nice frame and I like the focus and textures on it.  The scene beyond is a bit soft and lacks impact for me. Commenting only at this point - accepting  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #10 in my random display order.', '2015-05-26 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353696, 1150351, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the environment, but I keep looking for the big thing in the image and the only candidate is the high tension line in the distance. Using that fence line in the mid distance might have worked with different framing. I like the feeling of a big quite place, but I keep hunting for the unifying element.</td>', 'I like the colors and the environment, but I keep looking for the big thing in the image and the only candidate is the high tension line in the distance. Using that fence line in the mid distance might have worked with different framing. I like the feeling of a big quite place, but I keep hunting for the unifying element.', '2015-05-26 18:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353698, 1150627, 16106, '<td valign="top">A bit more of that spectacular crepuscular light in the upper right would not have been a bad idea, but this is one of the best images in the challenge thus far, its just that the top feels a bit squeezed.</td>', 'A bit more of that spectacular crepuscular light in the upper right would not have been a bad idea, but this is one of the best images in the challenge thus far, its just that the top feels a bit squeezed.', '2015-05-26 18:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7353897, 1150441, 16106, '<td valign="top">There are far more creative shots in this challenge, but this is the best. Some times a deftly handled straightforward presentation of the subject matter is the best approach. And this is a spectacular landscape.</td>', 'There are far more creative shots in this challenge, but this is the best. Some times a deftly handled straightforward presentation of the subject matter is the best approach. And this is a spectacular landscape.', '2015-05-27 04:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354015, 1150222, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, unexpected, original.  Landscape as life. Life as landscape too. Yellow thumb for you. 9.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147147.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beautiful, unexpected, original.  Landscape as life. Life as landscape too. Yellow thumb for you. 9.  Thank you.', '2015-05-27 09:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354016, 1150658, 30364, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  Thrilling, compelling picture.  It''s the Red Thumb for you, and 9, and thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147146" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147146.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147146.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147146.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Fabulous.  Thrilling, compelling picture.  It''s the Red Thumb for you, and 9, and thank you.', '2015-05-27 09:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354042, 1150626, 30364, '<td valign="top">Simply the best.  This is a beautiful, original, searing photograph.  Tones, shapes, movement and dynamism, all out of what we lesser mugs would see as nothing, or more likely not see at all.  No way to forget this, and why would I want to?  10 and the True Blue Thumb for You.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1147145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1147145.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Simply the best.  This is a beautiful, original, searing photograph.  Tones, shapes, movement and dynamism, all out of what we lesser mugs would see as nothing, or more likely not see at all.  No way to forget this, and why would I want to?  10 and the True Blue Thumb for You.  Thank you.', '2015-05-27 10:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354046, 1150581, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think we have a winner! Great shot!</td>', 'I think we have a winner! Great shot!', '2015-05-27 11:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354142, 1150509, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this.  I''m a sucker for fog anyway, but I like the lush look, the soft background and the very cool tones.</td>', 'Love this.  I''m a sucker for fog anyway, but I like the lush look, the soft background and the very cool tones.', '2015-05-27 15:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354143, 1150627, 2553, '<td valign="top">I do like this, but I feel like I want more sky...this feels somehow restrained to me.  Still nice though!</td>', 'I do like this, but I feel like I want more sky...this feels somehow restrained to me.  Still nice though!', '2015-05-27 15:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354146, 1150630, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a crazy sky!  I like composition of this a lot.  I think I like that black and white too...all tones and no distractions.  A little over-sharp for my taste range, but doesn''t really take away from the image.</td>', 'Wow, what a crazy sky!  I like composition of this a lot.  I think I like that black and white too...all tones and no distractions.  A little over-sharp for my taste range, but doesn''t really take away from the image.', '2015-05-27 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354152, 1150571, 2553, '<td valign="top">This looks like it should be a print.  I love the toning and the soft feel.  I think I would have cropped out the distractions to the left, just at the edge of the small building (IMO neither the bldg or small tower, or the sky on the left really "add" to the image, and to eliminate them would put all the focus on the bridge and the larger tower).  That would have made it a more powerful image for me.  As I said, just my opinion!  I do enjoy the image!</td>', 'This looks like it should be a print.  I love the toning and the soft feel.  I think I would have cropped out the distractions to the left, just at the edge of the small building (IMO neither the bldg or small tower, or the sky on the left really "add" to the image, and to eliminate them would put all the focus on the bridge and the larger tower).  That would have made it a more powerful image for me.  As I said, just my opinion!  I do enjoy the image!', '2015-05-27 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354160, 1150478, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m generally not a fan of images that are "fuzzy", usually even when that is by design.  This however, really caught my attention.  I love the very artistic look of the image, and it clearly conveys the feeling of a "savanna" in the wild.</td>', 'I''m generally not a fan of images that are "fuzzy", usually even when that is by design.  This however, really caught my attention.  I love the very artistic look of the image, and it clearly conveys the feeling of a "savanna" in the wild.', '2015-05-27 15:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354164, 1150489, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the scene very much, but for me, it really calls for more processing.  I''m definitely not a "purist", so do see things differently!  Beautiful view though!</td>', 'I like the scene very much, but for me, it really calls for more processing.  I''m definitely not a "purist", so do see things differently!  Beautiful view though!', '2015-05-27 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
