(7354264, 1150642, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''ve accepted <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #9 in my random display order.<br/> <br/>I love the processing on this image.  Turns a relatively ordinary field into something of beauty.  Nice details and composition.</td>', 'I''ve accepted  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #9 in my random display order. I love the processing on this image.  Turns a relatively ordinary field into something of beauty.  Nice details and composition.', '2015-05-27 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
