(7354275, 1150643, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''ve accepted <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #5 in my random display order.<br/> <br/>Nice use of geometric structure.  I like the graffiti... not a fan of the blur.  (comment only)</td>', 'I''ve accepted  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #5 in my random display order. Nice use of geometric structure.  I like the graffiti... not a fan of the blur.  (comment only)', '2015-05-27 19:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
