(7354277, 1150616, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''ve accepted <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #7 in my random display order.<br/> <br/>Nice reflection.  Think the image may have benefited from a different angle, and/or a longer exposure.  (comment only)</td>', 'I''ve accepted  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #7 in my random display order. Nice reflection.  Think the image may have benefited from a different angle, and/or a longer exposure.  (comment only)', '2015-05-27 19:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354278, 1150564, 32011, '<td valign="top">I''ve accepted <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #8 in my random display order.<br/> <br/>Beautiful colour and composition.</td>', 'I''ve accepted  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #8 in my random display order. Beautiful colour and composition.', '2015-05-27 19:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354290, 1150598, 125410, '<td valign="top">Yeah</td>', 'Yeah', '2015-05-27 19:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354293, 1150582, 125410, '<td valign="top">This looks almost like a painting, beautiful.</td>', 'This looks almost like a painting, beautiful.', '2015-05-27 19:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354297, 1150574, 125410, '<td valign="top">A little too heavy on the color saturation on this one... looks a bit unnatural for the grass/cows to be so brightly lit.</td>', 'A little too heavy on the color saturation on this one... looks a bit unnatural for the grass/cows to be so brightly lit.', '2015-05-27 19:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354298, 1150399, 125410, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, however the fisherman seems to pull the focus forward, on first glance I didn''t even notice the snowy mountains in the background.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, however the fisherman seems to pull the focus forward, on first glance I didn''t even notice the snowy mountains in the background.', '2015-05-27 19:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354300, 1150477, 125410, '<td valign="top">Gotta love a landscape shot in portrait :)</td>', 'Gotta love a landscape shot in portrait :)', '2015-05-27 19:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354303, 1150630, 125410, '<td valign="top">Little heavy on the HDR for the clouds... the posts and benches look nice though.</td>', 'Little heavy on the HDR for the clouds... the posts and benches look nice though.', '2015-05-27 19:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354304, 1150441, 125410, '<td valign="top">The challenge says a landscape doesn''t have to be dramatic to be memorable... but it sure helps! Beautiful shot!</td>', 'The challenge says a landscape doesn''t have to be dramatic to be memorable... but it sure helps! Beautiful shot!', '2015-05-27 19:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354306, 1150563, 125410, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, my only critique is that the contrast in the bush on the right is a bit extreme, the edges of the shadows on those branches are sharp!</td>', 'Wonderful shot, my only critique is that the contrast in the bush on the right is a bit extreme, the edges of the shadows on those branches are sharp!', '2015-05-27 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354357, 1150607, 86447, '<td valign="top">Not at ALL a fan of the blue processing... but I LOVE the scene!   7</td>', 'Not at ALL a fan of the blue processing... but I LOVE the scene!   7', '2015-05-27 21:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354424, 1150627, 177322, '<td valign="top">Golden. Serene. Engaging PoV. Plenty to contemplate on here. Lovely work.</td>', 'Golden. Serene. Engaging PoV. Plenty to contemplate on here. Lovely work.', '2015-05-27 23:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354435, 1150554, 177322, '<td valign="top">The bold, brassy colors really make this image stand out. The star filter certainly adds extra dazzle.  My one nitpick, uneven water line.  Other than that, very attractive image.</td>', 'The bold, brassy colors really make this image stand out. The star filter certainly adds extra dazzle.  My one nitpick, uneven water line.  Other than that, very attractive image.', '2015-05-27 23:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354456, 1150654, 177322, '<td valign="top">For me, the light is glaringly harsh.  Maybe a ND filter would have helped?  Compositionally, there is a lot going on horizontally with posts, ropes, different levels of beach, the horizon.  If you could have gotten the same shot sans the ropes, I think it would stronger compositionally.  Alas, you worked with what you had. Very pretty area, BTW.</td>', 'For me, the light is glaringly harsh.  Maybe a ND filter would have helped?  Compositionally, there is a lot going on horizontally with posts, ropes, different levels of beach, the horizon.  If you could have gotten the same shot sans the ropes, I think it would stronger compositionally.  Alas, you worked with what you had. Very pretty area, BTW.', '2015-05-28 00:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354462, 1150440, 177322, '<td valign="top">The power of that right boulder jutting into the sunset (?sunrise?) really commands this image.  Only after the eye gets past that bulk do the subtleties of the distant hills emerge. I am impressed with how you have used the rock and the tree to the left to frame the land. If I had to use one word to describe this image: magnificent.</td>', 'The power of that right boulder jutting into the sunset (?sunrise?) really commands this image.  Only after the eye gets past that bulk do the subtleties of the distant hills emerge. I am impressed with how you have used the rock and the tree to the left to frame the land. If I had to use one word to describe this image: magnificent.', '2015-05-28 00:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354465, 1150391, 177322, '<td valign="top">What a pretty place.  Those flowers blooming on the platform make me smile.  Is that a little turtle taking a sunbath on the lower left of that platform?  Good luck with this pleasing image.</td>', 'What a pretty place.  Those flowers blooming on the platform make me smile.  Is that a little turtle taking a sunbath on the lower left of that platform?  Good luck with this pleasing image.', '2015-05-28 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354466, 1150646, 177322, '<td valign="top">Minimalism can be very striking - and so it is with this image. Best of luck with this dramatic photo.</td>', 'Minimalism can be very striking - and so it is with this image. Best of luck with this dramatic photo.', '2015-05-28 00:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354473, 1150657, 150277, '<td valign="top">This is nice, calming. An unusual take on landscape perhaps, but I am enjoying. The dragonflys are perfect.</td>', 'This is nice, calming. An unusual take on landscape perhaps, but I am enjoying. The dragonflys are perfect.', '2015-05-28 00:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354475, 1150652, 150277, '<td valign="top">I struggled a bit with this image. The unevenness of the pink in the sky bothered my brain a bit - it feels a bit like the blue is so light that the image is unbalanced. (The pink seems heavy as does the almost silhouette tree, making the bottom heavy and the top light.). I suspect it was a gorgeous scene, I am just not sure I felt the complete glory.</td>', 'I struggled a bit with this image. The unevenness of the pink in the sky bothered my brain a bit - it feels a bit like the blue is so light that the image is unbalanced. (The pink seems heavy as does the almost silhouette tree, making the bottom heavy and the top light.). I suspect it was a gorgeous scene, I am just not sure I felt the complete glory.', '2015-05-28 00:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354477, 1150637, 150277, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. I really like the browns and golds, that made it feel warm. I also like the unique nature of this shot. The green at the bottom did not add much to this image for me. In some ways I felt that greenery kept pulling my eyes away from that beautiful golden light.</td>', 'Interesting image. I really like the browns and golds, that made it feel warm. I also like the unique nature of this shot. The green at the bottom did not add much to this image for me. In some ways I felt that greenery kept pulling my eyes away from that beautiful golden light.', '2015-05-28 00:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354478, 1150571, 150277, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites, like ever. Moody and dark, with calming water and just a hint of a background. Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'One of my favorites, like ever. Moody and dark, with calming water and just a hint of a background. Thanks for sharing.', '2015-05-28 00:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354486, 1150519, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the rich tones, but the division between groups of monuments puts the void between them center stage leaving the eye scurrying between them. Featuring either one of the groups would have made a stronger image.</td>', 'I like the rich tones, but the division between groups of monuments puts the void between them center stage leaving the eye scurrying between them. Featuring either one of the groups would have made a stronger image.', '2015-05-28 01:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354502, 1150475, 135744, '<td valign="top">Lovely looking clouds. I am not keen on the approx 50/50 divide of the land and the sky.</td>', 'Lovely looking clouds. I am not keen on the approx 50/50 divide of the land and the sky.', '2015-05-28 06:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354503, 1150652, 135744, '<td valign="top">Nice sky. Not keen on the processing of the land - something a bit unnatural about it but could be just my eyes:)</td>', 'Nice sky. Not keen on the processing of the land - something a bit unnatural about it but could be just my eyes:)', '2015-05-28 06:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354505, 1150477, 135744, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the sea and rocks works well.</td>', 'The contrast of the sea and rocks works well.', '2015-05-28 06:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354506, 1150399, 135744, '<td valign="top">Very well captured. Love the layers of different terrains with the icing on the cake being those lovely snow capped mountains.</td>', 'Very well captured. Love the layers of different terrains with the icing on the cake being those lovely snow capped mountains.', '2015-05-28 06:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354507, 1150639, 135744, '<td valign="top">Feel like there should be something in the middle - this is probably just me. I find landscape photography very difficult which is frustrating as I live in a village surrounded by wonderful countryside not dissimilar to what you have captured.</td>', 'Feel like there should be something in the middle - this is probably just me. I find landscape photography very difficult which is frustrating as I live in a village surrounded by wonderful countryside not dissimilar to what you have captured.', '2015-05-28 06:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354508, 1150611, 135744, '<td valign="top">Great panorama. I assume this must be Istanbul as I recognise one of the Mosques. Wonderful city and amazing you can walk across a bridge to get from Europe to Asia.</td>', 'Great panorama. I assume this must be Istanbul as I recognise one of the Mosques. Wonderful city and amazing you can walk across a bridge to get from Europe to Asia.', '2015-05-28 06:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354509, 1150593, 135744, '<td valign="top">What a magical scene. That water is beautiful and you have framed it perfectly. You may get some negative feedback on the Vignette but I have no problem with it at all. I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'What a magical scene. That water is beautiful and you have framed it perfectly. You may get some negative feedback on the Vignette but I have no problem with it at all. I hope this does well for you.', '2015-05-28 06:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354545, 1150631, 150277, '<td valign="top">Interesting landscape.  As an image, this evokes feelings of interest, but the colors seem really muted and I did not feel a sense of drama or awe like I tend to enjoy in landscape.  The image also seemed a bit off balance with such a heavy emphasis of the eye to the right of center.</td>', 'Interesting landscape.  As an image, this evokes feelings of interest, but the colors seem really muted and I did not feel a sense of drama or awe like I tend to enjoy in landscape.  The image also seemed a bit off balance with such a heavy emphasis of the eye to the right of center.', '2015-05-28 09:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354546, 1150477, 150277, '<td valign="top">If these colors are how you saw this view, I bet it was spectacular.  Unfortunately this did not connect well with me, the view was just so narrow that aside from enjoying the pink and green, nothing else really held my interest.</td>', 'If these colors are how you saw this view, I bet it was spectacular.  Unfortunately this did not connect well with me, the view was just so narrow that aside from enjoying the pink and green, nothing else really held my interest.', '2015-05-28 09:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354547, 1150568, 150277, '<td valign="top">I found this scene pretty, but the tree overlapping the pond really bothered me.</td>', 'I found this scene pretty, but the tree overlapping the pond really bothered me.', '2015-05-28 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354548, 1150511, 150277, '<td valign="top">Nice find.  I like the composition you chose and the tall black building walls wonderfully framed and gave perspective to the little (palm?) trees.  I really enjoyed this image.</td>', 'Nice find.  I like the composition you chose and the tall black building walls wonderfully framed and gave perspective to the little (palm?) trees.  I really enjoyed this image.', '2015-05-28 09:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354552, 1150567, 150277, '<td valign="top">Busy scene.  I''m not sure I connected well with what must have been the grandeur of your view when you took this.</td>', 'Busy scene.  I''m not sure I connected well with what must have been the grandeur of your view when you took this.', '2015-05-28 09:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354555, 1150611, 150277, '<td valign="top">I feel like I wanted to see more detail in the back area - I could see hints of buildings but it wasn''t a pure silhouette either.  Nice drama in the lighting by the boat, but I didn''t feel the drama in the rest of the image.</td>', 'I feel like I wanted to see more detail in the back area - I could see hints of buildings but it wasn''t a pure silhouette either.  Nice drama in the lighting by the boat, but I didn''t feel the drama in the rest of the image.', '2015-05-28 09:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354560, 1150630, 150277, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I am going to use the exact right words here, sorry in advance.  I like the drama in the clouds, and I am enjoying the overall composition you chose - it''s very serene, but the clouds almost seem oversharpened or structure setting was too high maybe?  They just feel a little unrealistic.</td>', 'I am not sure I am going to use the exact right words here, sorry in advance.  I like the drama in the clouds, and I am enjoying the overall composition you chose - it''s very serene, but the clouds almost seem oversharpened or structure setting was too high maybe?  They just feel a little unrealistic.', '2015-05-28 09:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354563, 1150591, 150277, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that I liked the simplicity and the gradiations of grays and light.  I am assuming this is some sort of landscape view, but I''m having trouble strongly connecting this image to the concept of landscape.  I want to see a hint of more I guess.</td>', 'My first impression was that I liked the simplicity and the gradiations of grays and light.  I am assuming this is some sort of landscape view, but I''m having trouble strongly connecting this image to the concept of landscape.  I want to see a hint of more I guess.', '2015-05-28 09:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354688, 1150351, 14008, '<td valign="top">the lighting is somewhat flat, but then so is the landscape!</td>', 'the lighting is somewhat flat, but then so is the landscape!', '2015-05-28 17:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354689, 1150540, 14008, '<td valign="top">what a great location</td>', 'what a great location', '2015-05-28 17:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354690, 1150674, 14008, '<td valign="top">great use of shape and form to make a dramatic image</td>', 'great use of shape and form to make a dramatic image', '2015-05-28 17:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354691, 1150581, 14008, '<td valign="top">a classic scene, rendered in rich warm colours</td>', 'a classic scene, rendered in rich warm colours', '2015-05-28 17:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354692, 1150382, 14008, '<td valign="top">a simple scene, lifted by some strong colours and composition</td>', 'a simple scene, lifted by some strong colours and composition', '2015-05-28 17:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354693, 1150511, 14008, '<td valign="top">well done for avoiding converged verticals, seriously skilled!</td>', 'well done for avoiding converged verticals, seriously skilled!', '2015-05-28 17:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354694, 1150607, 14008, '<td valign="top">very atmospheric lighting and post processing</td>', 'very atmospheric lighting and post processing', '2015-05-28 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354695, 1150675, 14008, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal effect here, great post processing</td>', 'I like the surreal effect here, great post processing', '2015-05-28 17:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354696, 1150646, 14008, '<td valign="top">creates a feeling of immense space</td>', 'creates a feeling of immense space', '2015-05-28 17:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354697, 1150630, 14008, '<td valign="top">quite a striking image.  I''m not sure I like it, but I''m sure that doesn''t stop it being great art.</td>', 'quite a striking image.  I''m not sure I like it, but I''m sure that doesn''t stop it being great art.', '2015-05-28 17:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354698, 1150475, 14008, '<td valign="top">great location, I wonder if it would be even better focused on the interesting fencing/terracing and losing the cloud?</td>', 'great location, I wonder if it would be even better focused on the interesting fencing/terracing and losing the cloud?', '2015-05-28 17:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354699, 1150564, 14008, '<td valign="top">great light</td>', 'great light', '2015-05-28 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354700, 1150597, 14008, '<td valign="top">a classic</td>', 'a classic', '2015-05-28 17:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354701, 1150645, 14008, '<td valign="top">amazing use of depth of field (but is it a landscape!?)</td>', 'amazing use of depth of field (but is it a landscape!?)', '2015-05-28 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354702, 1150563, 14008, '<td valign="top">you have a fantastic back yard!</td>', 'you have a fantastic back yard!', '2015-05-28 17:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354703, 1150626, 14008, '<td valign="top">how to make something out of nothing, great atmosphere</td>', 'how to make something out of nothing, great atmosphere', '2015-05-28 17:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354717, 1150631, 177322, '<td valign="top">Totally and absolutely cool!!!</td>', 'Totally and absolutely cool!!!', '2015-05-28 18:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354718, 1150528, 177322, '<td valign="top">The way this beckons the viewer beyond the lovely frame of the tunnel structure makes me want to keep moving along the road.  Quite engaging.</td>', 'The way this beckons the viewer beyond the lovely frame of the tunnel structure makes me want to keep moving along the road.  Quite engaging.', '2015-05-28 18:32:32.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7354720, 1150564, 177322, '<td valign="top">Not quite seeing the fourth, fire, but that makes no difference.  This is beautifully lit, well crafted and processed - I barely notice that chunk of a building in the lower right.  Good luck.</td>', 'Not quite seeing the fourth, fire, but that makes no difference.  This is beautifully lit, well crafted and processed - I barely notice that chunk of a building in the lower right.  Good luck.', '2015-05-28 18:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354729, 1150657, 177322, '<td valign="top">Oh - those dragon flies are so enchanting!  The silhouette of the bird works. Nicely balanced composition.  Good luck!</td>', 'Oh - those dragon flies are so enchanting!  The silhouette of the bird works. Nicely balanced composition.  Good luck!', '2015-05-28 19:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354806, 1150607, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones.</td>', 'Lovely tones.', '2015-05-28 23:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354858, 1150582, 118703, '<td valign="top">Like the processing, lovely light, although there doesnt seem to be a focal point</td>', 'Like the processing, lovely light, although there doesnt seem to be a focal point', '2015-05-29 00:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354946, 1150222, 75618, '<td valign="top">I like that revelatory moment, after seeing the incentive spirometer, bedside commode and all the tiny clues in the picture, when I slowly figured out what I was looking at.  Where I am and where I''d rather be.  A nice and refreshing take on the challenge. 8</td>', 'I like that revelatory moment, after seeing the incentive spirometer, bedside commode and all the tiny clues in the picture, when I slowly figured out what I was looking at.  Where I am and where I''d rather be.  A nice and refreshing take on the challenge. 8', '2015-05-29 07:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7354947, 1150554, 75618, '<td valign="top">A view/perspective that has been seen countless of times, but this is technically well done (aside from some patchy blue spots in the sky).  6</td>', 'A view/perspective that has been seen countless of times, but this is technically well done (aside from some patchy blue spots in the sky).  6', '2015-05-29 07:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
