(7355227, 1150385, 94815, '<td valign="top">What a riot of photographic clichees!! There''s a patch of layers in the center and a great sunstar peaking through the silhouetted trees; high clouds and their reflections in the almost still waters; and last but not least an unexpected and surreal group of dolphins breaching out of the black shoreline (or maybe just some leaves). By any count a fascinating image. bump</td>', 'What a riot of photographic clichees!! There''s a patch of layers in the center and a great sunstar peaking through the silhouetted trees; high clouds and their reflections in the almost still waters; and last but not least an unexpected and surreal group of dolphins breaching out of the black shoreline (or maybe just some leaves). By any count a fascinating image. bump', '2015-05-29 23:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355228, 1150627, 94815, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape elements: water, rocks, reflections, and sun rays. Only downside: the burned out sun reflection (or maybe its just my monitor). voted earlier a 7</td>', 'Lovely landscape elements: water, rocks, reflections, and sun rays. Only downside: the burned out sun reflection (or maybe its just my monitor). voted earlier a 7', '2015-05-29 23:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
