(7355367, 1150654, 77185, '<td valign="top">That fence really gives a feeling of being restricted from that nice beach. It almost stops me from looking further beyond it, and what a shame that would be! You can''t fool me, fence.</td>', 'That fence really gives a feeling of being restricted from that nice beach. It almost stops me from looking further beyond it, and what a shame that would be! You can''t fool me, fence.', '2015-05-31 05:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355368, 1150475, 77185, '<td valign="top">Lovely and idyllic, but with a great big looming cloud. I like the processing on this, not overdone as some (including me) might be tempted to do to emphasis the clouds. On another note, I''m glad I don''t have to keep those fences painted white!</td>', 'Lovely and idyllic, but with a great big looming cloud. I like the processing on this, not overdone as some (including me) might be tempted to do to emphasis the clouds. On another note, I''m glad I don''t have to keep those fences painted white!', '2015-05-31 05:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
