(7355513, 1150511, 62249, '<td valign="top">An interesting architectural shot. Not exactly what I think of as a landscape, but I guess if you''re in a city, palm trees by the pool have to suffice. Try this shot again in a future challenge geared toward buildings, architecture, geometry, etc. I think you could turn this view into a pretty great shot.</td>', 'An interesting architectural shot. Not exactly what I think of as a landscape, but I guess if you''re in a city, palm trees by the pool have to suffice. Try this shot again in a future challenge geared toward buildings, architecture, geometry, etc. I think you could turn this view into a pretty great shot.', '2015-05-31 20:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355514, 1150657, 62249, '<td valign="top">The dragonflies add a delightful element to this shot.</td>', 'The dragonflies add a delightful element to this shot.', '2015-05-31 20:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7355515, 1150658, 62249, '<td valign="top">The grain works surprisingly well here.</td>', 'The grain works surprisingly well here.', '2015-05-31 20:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
