(7355650, 1150222, 138630, '<td valign="top">Speed voter thought: this is a landscape?  Upon reflection thought: wow, what a take on the challenge and what a way to introduce real human emotion into the theme.  Love the title - I think it helped me pause and reconsider.  Commenting only at this point - accepting <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s challenge; yours is image #2 in my random display order.<br/>Back to say I still like this very much.  Thanks for the approach.</td>', 'Speed voter thought: this is a landscape?  Upon reflection thought: wow, what a take on the challenge and what a way to introduce real human emotion into the theme.  Love the title - I think it helped me pause and reconsider.  Commenting only at this point - accepting  Melethia''s challenge; yours is image #2 in my random display order.Back to say I still like this very much.  Thanks for the approach.', '2015-06-01 00:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
