(7355787, 1150588, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zita:</b></div><hr/><i> Forgive me, but I must be blunt:  for me, the infrared simply doesn''t work - it converts the silo into some sort of phallic presence and the vegetation is too snowy. For my personal taste, I would have liked to have seen this in B&amp;W or natural colors. Notwithstanding, I respect your artistic expression.<br/> <br/>Please know, I am commenting only.  No vote. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>FYI, your phallic silo is actually the color of dark chocolate, so you''ll need to take up it''s not working with the farmer.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''https://farm8.staticflickr.com/7040/7080915037_c39f49de07_c.jpg'', strrpos(''https://farm8.staticflickr.com/7040/7080915037_c39f49de07_c.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://farm8.staticflickr.com/7040/7080915037_c39f49de07_c.jpg"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-06-01 05:51:10.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Zita: Forgive me, but I must be blunt:  for me, the infrared simply doesn''t work - it converts the silo into some sort of phallic presence and the vegetation is too snowy. For my personal taste, I would have liked to have seen this in B&W or natural colors. Notwithstanding, I respect your artistic expression. Please know, I am commenting only.  No vote.   FYI, your phallic silo is actually the color of dark chocolate, so you''ll need to take up it''s not working with the farmer. ', '2015-06-01 06:47:46.000000', '2015-06-01 06:51:10.000000', 0),
(7355808, 1150588, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by armando_m:</b></div><hr/><i> infrared ? or uv? <br/> <br/>nice processing ! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Armando.  It''s from a 720nm IR converted D7000.</td>', 'Originally posted by armando_m: infrared ? or uv?  nice processing !   Thanks, Armando.  It''s from a 720nm IR converted D7000.', '2015-06-01 08:26:21.000000', NULL, 0),
