(7356329, 1150593, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bohemka:</b></div><hr/><i> Underrated. Masterfully framed. There were probably 1,000 chances to get a <i>good</i> photo out of this scene and you avoided that, framed it perfectly, worked with difficult light, and captured an exceptional photo here. Very well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Scott, really appreciated!</td>', 'Originally posted by bohemka: Underrated. Masterfully framed. There were probably 1,000 chances to get a good photo out of this scene and you avoided that, framed it perfectly, worked with difficult light, and captured an exceptional photo here. Very well done.   Thanks Scott, really appreciated!', '2015-06-02 08:07:12.000000', NULL, 0),
