(7358256, 1150631, 86090, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. Your subject is very interesting though might not have been what people had in mind for a landscape challenge. I think you did a very good job capturing the action, and because of that my eyes keep going to the right considering the left empty space not necessary. I would also like to see more vibrant colors and more contrast, as we are used to in your work.</td>', 'This is a great image. Your subject is very interesting though might not have been what people had in mind for a landscape challenge. I think you did a very good job capturing the action, and because of that my eyes keep going to the right considering the left empty space not necessary. I would also like to see more vibrant colors and more contrast, as we are used to in your work.', '2015-06-07 21:37:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7377639, 1150665, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Don...I do like this b&amp;w...I''ll start with the bad and then move to the good. I feel that the pic is too dark. That may have been what you were trying for though. I feel especially the trees on the left have lost tons of detail. However I do like the trees on the right. You can see detail there. Also I really like the clouds. The bridge is also interesting and looks good in the shot. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Don...I do like this b&w...I''ll start with the bad and then move to the good. I feel that the pic is too dark. That may have been what you were trying for though. I feel especially the trees on the left have lost tons of detail. However I do like the trees on the right. You can see detail there. Also I really like the clouds. The bridge is also interesting and looks good in the shot. Happy shooting', '2015-06-30 13:12:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7377687, 1150519, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Better late than never on getting a critique. We are trying to take care of some backlog. Now on to the pic. The first thing that really jumps out at me is the sky. I love those angry clouds. The colors I think are good. I have to agree with the comment that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16106" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">BrennanOB</a> made. I think the empty space in the middle actually hurts the image. You could have rotated the camera slightly to the left, still leaving the tree and the left graves out of center, I think it would have made an impact. Anyway happy shooting and keep it up. Nice shot</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Better late than never on getting a critique. We are trying to take care of some backlog. Now on to the pic. The first thing that really jumps out at me is the sky. I love those angry clouds. The colors I think are good. I have to agree with the comment that  BrennanOB made. I think the empty space in the middle actually hurts the image. You could have rotated the camera slightly to the left, still leaving the tree and the left graves out of center, I think it would have made an impact. Anyway happy shooting and keep it up. Nice shot', '2015-06-30 13:37:21.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
